{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/GroupPhoto.png?t=1749338583\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/Title_UnleashAdorableChaos.png?t=1749338583\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the paws of an adorable but mischievous pup! Left alone, this is your chance to explore, collect, and smash your way through 5 vibrant, interactive environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/kitchen-peeing.gif?t=1749338583\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles and dig into a howl-arious list of fun-filled shenanigans in an attempt to impress your feathered friends, who reward you with \u2728Mischievous Badges\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's sure to be a pawsitively unforgettable day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/DDC-What-To-Expect-600x65px.png?t=1749338583\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc36 Engaging single-player adventure </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf08 Vibrant 3D cartoon-style graphics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde6 14 adorable pawjama outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Puzzles to solve using found items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae 5 interactive environments <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img 